<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 439-4 V WESTERN PROVINCE ON FIRST DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 439-4 V WESTERN PROVINCE ON FIRST DAY.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 439 for four at the close of play on the first day of their three-day match against Western Province at Newlands on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia first innings 439-4 (Matthew Hayden 112, Mark Taylor 85, Matthew Elliott 74, Steve Waugh 69) v Western Province.</p>
